> The hints told users to put model IDs in atmos.yaml that the providers reject:
claude-sonnet-4-5-20250514 (anthropic) and anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250514-v2:0 (bedrock) are not real IDs. Sonnet 4.5 is claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929, which is what anthropic.DefaultModel and bedrock.DefaultModel already use.

@coderabbitai is there documentation we should update as part of this?
